349	\subsection{Statistical Analysis}
350	\label{subsec:9pathogen_statistical}
351	
352	To determine whether the observed method--pathogen dependence is statistically significant, three complementary statistical analyses were performed.
353	
354	\textbf{Three-way ANOVA ($\omega^2$).}
355	\label{subsec:9pathogen_anova}
356	To identify the major sources of performance variation, a three-way ANOVA was performed with MCC as the dependent variable.
357	The results using the bias-corrected effect size $\omega^2$ (Eq.~\ref{eq:omega_squared}) are presented in Table~\ref{tab:9pathogen_anova}.
358	
